    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1920,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 561.0,
      "height": 131.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1715784354,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1955037594,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792603194550,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AdveroSolutions org structure v3 APPROVED 2026-10-21 (20 bots)\nArrows = reporting lines only: Lorenzo > COO > manager > bot.\nCross-branch work goes manager > COO > manager.\nRooms coordinate; decisions escalate up the chain.\nManagers send one summary to COO; COO rolls up to Lorenzo 9:15 AM.\nLinkedIn: 3 named bots, one session at a time via the gate (li-227).\nGoal tracked: $20K 90 Day Sprint ($25K stretch: Lorenzo to confirm).",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AdveroSolutions org structure v3 APPROVED 2026-10-21 (20 bots)\nArrows = reporting lines only: Lorenzo > COO > manager > bot.\nCross-branch work goes manager > COO > manager.\nRooms coordinate; decisions escalate up the chain.\nManagers send one summary to COO; COO rolls up to Lorenzo 9:15 AM.\nLinkedIn: 3 named bots, one session at a time via the gate (li-227).\nGoal tracked: $20K 90 Day Sprint ($25K stretch: Lorenzo to confirm).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
